"Kyokutou Jikkenjou ~ Sentimental Experimentation" -- encompassing this
software, associated visual data, associated audio data, and associated
documentation files (collectively, the "Software") -- is an unofficial
derivative work based on the "Touhou Project" video game series by Team Shanghai
Alice.

Team Shanghai Alice's "Guidelines for Touhou Project Fan Creators" (the
"Guidelines") is a permissive guideline that gives details on the legal
requirements for publishing unofficial self-published derivative works based on
"Touhou Project". The Guidelines are accessible on the web site
	https://touhou-project.news/guideline/.
The copyright holder of the Software (the "Author") has determined that the
Software complies with the requirements explained by the Guidelines. Team
Shanghai Alice did not have a say in the development or publishing of the
Software.

